 all nationalities.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is it a freehold project?"},{"id":9054,"answer":"<p>Eltiera Views is set within Jumeirah Islands’ rare 2:1 land-to-water ratio, offering unmatched serenity, waterfront pathways, and quick access to JLT, Dubai Marina, Uptown Dubai, and Sheikh Zayed Road, positioning Eltiera Views Dubai as a premium, well-connected address.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes the location special?"},{"id":9055,"answer":"<p>The community includes infinity pools, spa suites, yoga decks, padel courts, co-working lounges, cinema rooms, kids’ play areas, landscaped podiums, retail, and F&amp;B, reflecting the elevated lifestyle of Ellington Eltiera Views Dubai.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are offered?"},{"id":9056,"answer":"<p>Investors choose Eltiera Views by Ellington for its high ROI potential, design-led craftsmanship, prime Jumeirah Islands address, excellent connectivity, strong rental demand, and limited luxury supply, making Eltiera Views Dubai a long-term value asset.</p>","question":"Why invest in Eltiera Views?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_23caa89de9.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Feature_23caa89de9.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x252/Feature_23caa89de9.webp","alias":"images","format":"webp","transform":"340x252","created_at":"2025-11-28 12:32:08.132","updated_at":"2025-11-28 12:32:08.132"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/464x312/Feature_23caa89de9.webp","alias":"images","format":"webp","transform":"464x312","created_at":"2025-11-28 12:32:08.132","updated_at":"2025-11-28 12:32:08.132"}]},{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_bba8963785.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Gallery_2_bba8963785.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-pr